Z||000000||Cliff D.||06-22-2000||05:06 PM||||First off, does anyone know if I can remove the plastic spare tire tray. I can't find anything in the IT specs. that say anything about retaining non-structural panels. I would really like to use the dead space over the sway bar and steering rack for cooling and ducting purposes. Any thoughts?<BR>The other question is... does anyone have any ideas on front ride-height control. I have an '85 and I am not allowed to change mounting points on the shocks. Ryane makes a coilover conversion kit which will allow me to jack the back, but I would sure like to have something for the front. If not, I guess I will just use springs to minimize the front ride-height and balance the weight with the rear. Oh well, any ideas? Thanks, Cliff||||reg||1
